*: https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-emby/compare/beta-4.11.0.9-ls1...beta-4.11.0.10-ls2","upstream":"﻿\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n\n\n### 4.11.0.10\n\n- Fix live TV regressions\n- Improve database performance\n- Fix play all and shuffle from folder view\n- Add options to render PGS, DVDSUB and DVBSUB subtitles directly in the browser without server-side burn-in. Requires Emby Server 4.11.0.10+.\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### Cumulative Changes Since Stable Release\r\n\r\n- Fix live TV regressions\n- Support image processing with svg files\n- Fix tv series nfo regression\n- Fix play from albums tab\n- Add Czech parental ratings\n- Trim recording file name to avoid PathTooLongException\n- Update to libvips 8.18\n- Support creating image collage with libvips\n- Fix network section coming up empty in directory picker on Windows\n- Support scheduling system wakes for recordings on macOS\n- Support scheduling system wakes for recordings on Linux\n- Support deleting to recycle bin on Linux\n- Fix recording regression\n- Fix regression with Included In display not showing collections\n- Disable scanning of combined season and episode numbers in file names (e.g. 408), and require a library option to enable it\n- Support dynamic series orders from Tvdb\n- Add automatic subtitles on skip back feature\n- Fix episodes without season numbers not showing in resume\n- Fix error for servers running on mono runtime\n- Filter duplicate entries in person credits\n- Improve search performance\n- Query fixes for extras belonging to multi-version movies\n- Fix cases of episode intro detection retrying failed files endlessly\n- Refresh metadata on playlists when removing items\n\r\n\r\n","upstream_url":"https://github.com/MediaBrowser/Emby.Releases/releases/tag/4.11.0.10"},"config":{"env":["PATH=/lsiopy/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin","HOME=/root","LANGUAGE=en_US.UTF-8","LANG=en_US.UTF-8","TERM=xterm","S6_CMD_WAIT_FOR_SERVICES_MAXTIME=0","S6_VERBOSITY=1","S6_S